/linear/14068410/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce9b68f635c51e00917f68e2fd3eece137cc866428907b1aa168dfb2bf1adeee" "basis" 2301 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068410/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-34914" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To find $\\text{dim}(\\text{Null}(Q))$, we reduce $Q$ to row echelon form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Q & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & 2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 4 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 12 & 7 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 16 & 8 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -9 & -12 & -3 & -10\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & 2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 4 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 16 & 8 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -9 & -12 & -3 & -10\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{4} & :={R}_{4}+(-4){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & 2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 4 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & -9 & -12 & -3 & -10\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{5} & :={R}_{5}+3{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & 2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 4 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe reduced matrix has $5$ pivot columns and no non-pivot columns. \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\text{dim}(\\text{Null}(Q))=0.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068410/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce9b68f635c51e00917f68e2fd3eece137cc866428907b1aa168dfb2bf1adeee" "basis" 2301 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068410/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-34914" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068410/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a5606ebf5